## ৫. সময়, স্থান ও নির্দেশক শব্দের পরিবর্তন

| Direct     | Indirect                          |
| ---------- | --------------------------------- |
| now        | then                              |
| today      | that day                          |
| tomorrow   | the next day / the following day  |
| yesterday  | the previous day / the day before |
| last night | the previous night                |
| next week  | the following week                |
| here       | there                             |
| this       | that                              |
| these      | those                             |
| thus       | so                                |
| ago        | before                            |
| come       | go                                |

```text
                 WORD CHANGE
                      |
        +-------------+-------------+
        |             |             |
       TIME          PLACE        DEMONSTRATIVE
        |             |             |
        v             v             v
   now → then    here → there   this → that
   today →       come → go      these → those
   that day
   tomorrow →
   next day
   yesterday →
   previous day
```

