## কিছু গুরুত্বপূর্ণ অতিরিক্ত নিয়ম

### ১. Reporting verb-এ object না থাকলে

* say → say
* tell → tell
* said to → told

```text
             REPORTING VERB
                    |
          +---------+---------+
          |                   |
        Object              No Object
          |                   |
          v                   v
       said to → told      said → said
```

### ২. Well, oh, hello, bye ইত্যাদি

Direct-এ থাকলে Indirect-এ প্রায়ই বাদ যায় বা যথাযথ verb ব্যবহৃত হয়।

```text
        Well / Oh / Hello / Bye
                    |
                    v
              Indirect Speech
                    |
             +------+------+
             |             |
          বাদ যায়      উপযুক্ত Verb
```

### ৩. Address (সম্বোধন)

Direct-এ সম্বোধন থাকলে Indirect-এ reporting verb-এর object হিসেবে বসে।

* He said, "Rahim, come here." → He told **Rahim** to come there.

```text
              ADDRESS
                 |
                 v
        Reporting Verb-এর
             Object
                 |
                 v
              Rahim
                 |
                 v
        He told Rahim to...
```

### ৪. Yes/No

Direct-এ yes/no থাকলে Indirect-এ **replied in the affirmative/negative** বা **answered that...** ব্যবহৃত হয়।

```text
                YES / NO
                    |
          +---------+---------+
          |                   |
         YES                  NO
          |                   |
          v                   v
   affirmative          negative
          |                   |
          +---------+---------+
                    |
                    v
             replied/answered
```

### ৫. Sir/Madam

Respectfully / politely যুক্ত হয়।

```text
                Sir / Madam
                     |
                     v
               Respect shown
                     |
                     v
            respectfully /
               politely
```

