## সংক্ষিপ্ত সারাংশ

| Direct-এর ধরন | Reporting Verb                       | Connector           |
| ------------- | ------------------------------------ | ------------------- |
| Assertive     | said, told                           | that                |
| Interrogative | asked, enquired                      | if/whether, wh-word |
| Imperative    | ordered, requested, advised, forbade | to / not to         |
| Optative      | wished, prayed                       | that                |
| Exclamatory   | exclaimed                            | that                |

```text
                    NARRATION
                       |
       +-------+-------+-------+-------+
       |       |       |       |       |
       v       v       v       v       v
   Assertive  Inter. Imperative Optative Exclamatory
       |       |       |       |       |
      that   if/WH   to/not to  that     that
       |       |       |       |       |
     said    asked   ordered  wished  exclaimed
     told             requested prayed
                      advised
```

